-- Tests for wra3-sch9.l4 (Schedule 9). Expected values are written from the text (raw lines 3250-3252, 3269, 3335-3339,
-- 3346-3350), decided before running.

§ `sch 9 para 5 SSCBA 64(1A)`

#ASSERT `sch 9 para 5 SSCBA 64(1A) the allowance is within subsection (1A)` `sch 9 para 5 SSCBA 64(1A)(a) personal independence payment` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 9 para 5 SSCBA 64(1A) the allowance is within subsection (1A)` `sch 9 para 5 SSCBA 64(1A)(b) the care component of a disability living allowance` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 9 para 5 SSCBA 64(1A) the allowance is within subsection (1A)` `sch 9 para 5 any other allowance` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 9 para 11 SSAA 73(6)`

#ASSERT `sch 9 para 11 SSAA 73(6) the benefit is treated for the purposes of section 73 as if it were benefit as defined in section 122 of the Contributions and Benefits Act` `personal independence payment` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 9 para 11 SSAA 73(6) the benefit is treated for the purposes of section 73 as if it were benefit as defined in section 122 of the Contributions and Benefits Act` `disability living allowance` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 9 para 11 SSAA 73(6) the benefit is treated for the purposes of section 73 as if it were benefit as defined in section 122 of the Contributions and Benefits Act` `universal credit` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 9 para 31 SSAA 187(1)(ad)`

#ASSERT `sch 9 para 31 SSAA 187(1)(ad) the benefit is within the limb` `personal independence payment` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 9 para 31 SSAA 187(1)(ad) the benefit is within the limb` `universal credit` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 9 para 31 SSAA 187(1)(ad) the benefit is within the limb` `disability living allowance` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 9 para 43 SSA1998 Sch 3 para 3`

#ASSERT `sch 9 para 43 SSA1998 Sch 3 para 3(h) and (i) an appeal lies against the decision` `sch 9 para 43 SSA1998 Sch 3 para 3(h) a decision as to regulations made under section 85(1) or 86(1) of the Welfare Reform Act 2012` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 9 para 43 SSA1998 Sch 3 para 3(h) and (i) an appeal lies against the decision` `sch 9 para 43 SSA1998 Sch 3 para 3(i) a decision as to section 87 of the Welfare Reform Act 2012` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 9 para 43 SSA1998 Sch 3 para 3(h) and (i) an appeal lies against the decision` `sch 9 para 43 any other decision` EQUALS NOTHING

